    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/medical-doctor/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Medical Doctor is a responsive and professional theme designed for healthcare professionals, including doctors, surgeons, dentists, physiotherapists, chiropractors, physicians, pharmacists, medical consultants, pathology labs, clinics, hospitals, veterinary doctors, and healthcare centers. Ideal for creating a modern medical website, clinic website, or hospital website, this theme features a clean, retina-ready design with a user-friendly interface, responsive sliders, Call To Action (CTA) buttons, interactive elements, and smooth animations to engage visitors effectively. Built on the robust Bootstrap framework, it offers easy customization with well-optimized HTML code for fast loading and seamless performance across all devices. Social media integration helps expand your online reach, while compatibility with WooCommerce enables selling medical products, healthcare services, and pharmacy items online. Plugin support includes Contact Form 7 for appointment booking, WPML for multilingual setup, and Yoast SEO for enhanced search visibility. With its professional design, SEO-friendly structure, and responsive layout, Medical Doctor is a reliable choice for clinics, hospitals, medical practitioners, and healthcare service providers seeking a polished and high-performing online presence. View : https://preview.themesglance.com/medical-doctor-pro/"
    },
